{"id":"ead6ebad4464a6c6","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-truth-predicate.md","title":"Truth Predicate","display":"df-truth-predicate — Truth Predicate","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-truth-predicate","aliases":["90-df-truth-predicate"],"display":"df-truth-predicate — Truth Predicate","depends_on":["[[90-df-sentence]]","[[90-df-godel-numbering]]","[[90-df-syntax-interface]]","[[88-df-structure]]","[[88-df-satisfaction]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-truth-predicate"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-truth-predicate</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-truth-predicate — Truth Predicate"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"714deb184f73887a\" href=\"?note=714deb184f73887a\" title=\"90-df-sentence\">90-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b86b211a75cf1748\" href=\"?note=b86b211a75cf1748\" title=\"90-df-godel-numbering\">90-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"61d70aa13427c3b5\" href=\"?note=61d70aa13427c3b5\" title=\"90-df-syntax-interface\">90-df-syntax-interface</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3a560d130315ebdc\" href=\"?note=3a560d130315ebdc\" title=\"88-df-structure\">88-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"7d0aefc635fe57fc\" href=\"?note=7d0aefc635fe57fc\" title=\"88-df-satisfaction\">88-df-satisfaction</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M\">\\(\\mathcal M\\)</span> 满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3a560d130315ebdc\" href=\"?note=3a560d130315ebdc\" title=\"88-df-structure\">88-df-structure</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_{S^\\sharp}\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_{S^\\sharp}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models\">\\(\\models\\)</span> 直接引用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"7d0aefc635fe57fc\" href=\"?note=7d0aefc635fe57fc\" title=\"88-df-satisfaction\">88-df-satisfaction</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S^\\sharp\">\\(S^\\sharp\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"61d70aa13427c3b5\" href=\"?note=61d70aa13427c3b5\" title=\"90-df-syntax-interface\">90-df-syntax-interface</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (formal signature)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M\">\\(\\mathcal M\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>-structure)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:\\operatorname{Expr}(S)\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(g:\\operatorname{Expr}(S)\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d:\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\operatorname{Expr}(S)\">\\(d:\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\operatorname{Expr}(S)\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GN}_{\\operatorname{Expr}(S)}(g,d)\">\\(\\mathrm{GN}_{\\operatorname{Expr}(S)}(g,d)\\)</span> (effective Gödel numbering)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span> (sentence set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"714deb184f73887a\" href=\"?note=714deb184f73887a\" title=\"90-df-sentence\">90-df-sentence</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{True}_{S,\\mathcal M,g}\">\\(\\mathrm{True}_{S,\\mathcal M,g}\\)</span> (external truth predicate, defined here)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}predicate}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{GN}_{\\operatorname{Expr}(S)}(g,d)\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathrm{True}_{S,\\mathcal M,g}(n)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\;\n\\bigl(n=g(\\sigma)\\land\\mathcal M\\models\\sigma\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}predicate}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{GN}_{\\operatorname{Expr}(S)}(g,d)\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathrm{True}_{S,\\mathcal M,g}(n)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\;\n\\bigl(n=g(\\sigma)\\land\\mathcal M\\models\\sigma\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>这是元语言中相对于对象语言、结构与编码定义的真句编码集，不声称它能由对象语言 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 自身的公式定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 是签名的一部分而不是隐藏参数。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"714deb184f73887a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"b86b211a75cf1748","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-syntax-interface","status":"resolved","id":"61d70aa13427c3b5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-syntax-interface]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"3a560d130315ebdc","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-d